# CyberCareer — environment configuration
# Copy this file to ".env" and fill in the values you want. All keys are OPTIONAL:
# without them the app still works (template cover letters, mailto email fallback).

# ── TLS (local dev only) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Set to 1 ONLY if outbound HTTPS fails to validate certificates on your dev
# machine (e.g. behind a corporate/AV TLS-intercepting proxy). This disables
# certificate verification process-wide — NEVER enable it in production.
# ALLOW_INSECURE_TLS=1

# ── AI / LLM (Writer Agent: cover letters + learning roadmap) ──────────────
# Provide ONE key below. By default the first provider with a key set is used,
# in this order: Anthropic, Gemini, OpenRouter, OpenAI. To force a specific one
# regardless of which keys are present, set LLM_PROVIDER.
# LLM_PROVIDER=gemini        # anthropic | gemini | openrouter | openai

# Anthropic Claude (paid)
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6

# Google Gemini — FREE tier, no credit card. Key: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash

# OpenRouter — FREE models (suffix ":free"). Key: https://openrouter.ai/keys
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=deepseek/deepseek-r1:free   # or meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct:free

# OpenAI (paid)
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o

# ── RAG embeddings (semantic job matching + grounded CareerBot) ────────────
# Reuses the GEMINI_API_KEY / OPENAI_API_KEY above. Gemini is preferred (free),
# then OpenAI. Set EMBED_PROVIDER to force one. Without a key, the app falls back
# to keyword matching and canned chat answers (no error).
# EMBED_PROVIDER=gemini        # gemini | openai
# GEMINI_EMBED_MODEL=gemini-embedding-001
# OPENAI_EMBED_MODEL=text-embedding-3-small

# ── Email notifications (send application by email) ────────────────────────
# Uses the Resend HTTP API (https://resend.com). Without it, the app falls back
# to opening the user's mail client via a mailto: link.
RESEND_API_KEY=
# RESEND_FROM=CyberCareer <onboarding@resend.dev>

# ── Optional job-search providers (already supported) ──────────────────────
# APIFY_TOKEN=
# JOOBLE_API_KEY=
# Adzuna — free aggregator API (surfaces StepStone/Indeed jobs legitimately).
# Register for free at https://developer.adzuna.com to get an app id + key.
# ADZUNA_APP_ID=
# ADZUNA_APP_KEY=
